{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">HYPERFIGHT 2 is the sequel to the original HYPERFIGHT, a fast-paced fighting game with no blocking and a unique meter system. This installment takes everything up to 11 - expanded movesets, more offensive and defensive options, and fresh new characters alongside returning favorites - while keeping the beloved accessibility of the original.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032970/extras/2025-05-0721-56-13-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1747733110\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Featuring:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> A fully voiced roster of characters, each with their own unique movesets and playstyles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Funky and energetic soundtrack composed by STEEL_PLUS</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Online multiplayer with rollback netcode and lobbies with up to 8 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Local versus, against player and CPU opponents</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Single player Arcade Mode, Training Mode, and Tutorial</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Full controller support, with rebindable controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> More to be revealed!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3032970?t=1747733110","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3032970?t=1747733110","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032970/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747733110","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032970/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747733110","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"desc